
@3 = ~Sir! Captain Nival We were informed that a large army was heading to the southern part of the city!~
@4 = ~I was afraid of that, I sent reinforcements there, but we suffered losses during the war with Luskan!~
@5 = ~Take one regiment into submission and advance to the southern walls, you will have to keep them! If the south wall falls, we are doomed! Go! ~
